sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sym as Production symptom
    participant DS as Data structure choice
    participant Op as Operation cost
    participant Fix as Implementation
    Sym->>DS: "find the top talkers in this log"
    DS-->>Op: heap of size k — O(n log k), bounded memory
    Sym->>DS: "has this host been seen before?"
    DS-->>Op: hash set — O(1) average, memory grows with cardinality
    Sym->>DS: "what is the p99 of these samples?"
    DS-->>Op: sort once, or a streaming sketch if it must be online
    Op->>Fix: pick for the constraint that actually binds
    Note over DS,Op: in an SRE interview the structure is chosen by memory ceiling as often as by time
